    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Most Appealing 3 Bed Coastal Residence Within Walking Distance of Beaches\n\nCill Dara, 12 Bán Mílís occupies a prime corner position within this highly sought-after coastal development of just 23 homes, ideally positioned between the village of Fethard and the beautiful beaches of the Hook Peninsula. Extending to approximately 103 sq m, the property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation with a warm and relaxed feel throughout. The welcoming entrance hall has timber flooring and leads to the living room with an attractive feature fireplace. This opens through to the kitchen/diner, which is fitted with a good range of units and integrated appliances. A generous sunroom overlooks the garden and opens directly onto the deck, providing an ideal space for outdoor entertaining. The ground floor is completed by a double bedroom and guest W.C. On the first floor there are two further bedrooms and a shower room. Outside, the property benefits from parking to the front together with private, low-maintenance gardens. The location is superb, within easy reach of Fethard-on-Sea village, local shops and amenities, and some of the finest beaches and coastal scenery on the Hook Peninsula. Whether as a permanent residence or holiday home, Cill Dara offers an excellent opportunity to enjoy all that this highly sought-after coastal area has to offer. Viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall 5.1m x 1.9m with timber flooring \n\nGuest w.c. 1.6m x 0.8m \n\nLiving room 4.5m x 4.1m with open fire and tiled floor \n\nKitchen 3.9m x 3m with range of fitted units, tiled floor and door garden\n\nSunroom 4.5m x 2.5m with door to raised deck area \n\nBedroom 1. 3.3m x 3m \n\nFirst floor\n\nBedroom 2. 4.1m x 3.3m with hotpress\n\nBedroom 3. 4.1m x 3.3m \n\nShower room 2.8m x 2m \n \nOUTSIDE: Generous corner plot, raised deck are, garden shed, parking and residents communal area\nSERVICES: Mains water, sewerage treatment system and electric heating, service charge applies \nBER: D\nEIRCODE: Y34AK12\nVIEWING: By prior appointment\n\n"
      },
